      "name": "DQ Sheet Cake",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/dq-sheet-cake.webp",
      "description": "DQ soft serve, hot fudge, crunchy center, and whipped topping in a large rectangular sheet cake format. Customizable with a personalized message. The right choice for large groups and events.",
