<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Large-Scale Event Catering: Why the Sheet Cake Reigns Supreme</h2>
  <p>When hosting sports banquets, office milestones, school graduations, or wedding rehearsals, managing individual dessert orders quickly becomes chaotic and expensive. The DQ Sheet Cake solves catering logistics in one sweep: yielding 24 to 32 cleanly sliced uniform squares at approximately $1.40 to $1.85 per guest. It gives every attendee the complete textural wonder of real soft serve and chocolate crunch center without blowing past party budgets. Explore all custom celebration options across <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> or our complete <a href="/categories/dq-cakes">DQ Cakes directory</a>.</p>
  <h2>DQ Cake Size Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>DQ Cake</th><th>Price</th><th>Serves</th><th>Format</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>8-inch Round</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$22.99+</td><td>8–10</td><td>Round</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>10-inch Round</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$32.99+</td><td>12–16</td><td>Round</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Oreo® Blizzard® Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$38.74+</td><td>12–16</td><td>Round, Oreo throughout</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Sheet Cake</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$44.99+</td><td>24–32</td><td>Rectangular</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Expert Ordering &amp; Venue Transport Recommendations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Order Window:</strong> Submit custom decorator requests at least 48 to 72 hours ahead—large sheet cakes require extended blast-chilling cycles to maintain crisp rectangular lines.</li>
    <li><strong>Custom Inscriptions &amp; Themes:</strong> Extended cake surface area allows for longer custom messages, sports logos, or festive color trims at no additional fee.</li>
    <li><strong>Vehicle Trunk Logistics:</strong> Transport the cake completely flat on a non-slip rubber mat or large level board in an air-conditioned vehicle; do not tilt on angled car seats.</li>
    <li><strong>Slicing Technique:</strong> For neat presentation squares, dip a long chef's knife into warm water and wipe dry between cuts; this glides smoothly through the hardened fudge crunch layer without tearing the whipped border.</li>
  </ul>
